      "statement": "authz.rs Session is an in-memory, never persisted allowlist: project_dir, allowed_escapes (pdf:allowPath approvals), known_projects (project_save refuses anything else), readable_pdfs (pdf_read refuses anything else), writable_exports (text_write and the pdf_embed_marks newPath target refuse anything else), stamps (mtime_nanos:len per file for stale-write detection via changed(), where Some to None is not changed), known_git_roots (assert_root re-checks every mutating git command), listed_splits, and heads (annotations folder and listed paper ids of each opened split project).",
