      "id": "claim_a959133aa2284871826faf94adc3d8bb",
      "statement": "webfetch.rs guards web_fetch against SSRF from LLM-supplied URLs: validate_fetch_url re-runs on every hop (http/https only, no embedded credentials, blocked literal IPs and localhost/.local/.internal/.localhost hostnames refused); blocked IPv6 covers loopback, unspecified, v4 ranges embedded in IPv4-mapped, IPv4-compatible, NAT64 and 6to4 addresses, fe80::/10, fc00::/7 and ff00::/8; check_public_host and the PublicOnly DNS resolver refuse any non-public address and close the DNS-rebinding window; the client uses no_proxy(); redirects are followed manually with re-validation up to 5 hops; a 20-second timeout, 2 MB body cap and textual-content-type gate apply.",
